# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms — https://web3forms.com)
#
# GitHub Pages is a static host with no server, so the form posts straight to
# Web3Forms from the browser. Get a free access key by entering your email at
# web3forms.com — no account needed; the key arrives by email.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means this value is inlined into the JavaScript bundle and is
# publicly visible. That is expected: a Web3Forms access key only permits
# sending mail to the address it was issued for, so it is not a secret in the
# way an API key normally is.
#
# Locally: copy this file to .env.local and fill it in.
# In CI: add it as the repository secret WEB3FORMS_KEY (see
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
